{
  "id": "star-chase",
  "name": "Star Chase",
  "description": "Collect gold, buy stars from the wandering Star Vendor, and grow strong enough to slay the Demon for two stars of your own. Mystery spaces deal island events; rivals can ambush you for your gold.",
